Description: Search: on-screen keyboard (DECKSMITHOS_TOUCH_KEYBOARD)
 With DECKSMITHOS_TOUCH_KEYBOARD set, the library search box shows an
 on-screen keyboard while it has the focus: a panel across the bottom of the
 window (45 % of its height) with digits, letters, - and ', Backspace (repeats
 while held), CLEAR, SPACE, HIDE and SEARCH (Return: search, then the focus
 goes to the tracks and the keyboard hides). Its keys never take the focus;
 they send key events to the search box. Styled with WTouchKeyboard and
 #TouchKeyboardKey. Mixxx has no on-screen keyboard on Linux (only iOS's
 system keyboard). Without the variable nothing changes.
Author: DecksmithOS
Forwarded: not-needed
Last-Update: 2026-11-22
